Setup Requirements
* Active n8n instance (cloud or self-hosted)
* Google Cloud Project with PageSpeed Insights API enabled and an API key
* Tavily Search API key
* Groq API key
* Airtable base with an Audits table created
* Connected Gmail account in n8n for sending approval emails

