Potential Enhancements
* Replace simulated search data with live Search Console API queries for verified domains.
* Add a CMS node (such as WordPress) following approval to automatically publish optimizations.
* Implement automated re-runs to track changes over time against historic Airtable records.
* Replace the manual trigger with an n8n Form trigger for team self-service requests.
